===============================================================================
GAME CONTENT
===============================================================================

This repository contains no Activision or Treyarch assets: no game code, no game
data, no audio, no shaders. Those come from your own legally owned copy of the
game and are not distributed here.

The recompiled game code under `CoD3RecompLib/ppc/` and
`CoD3RecompLib/levels/*/` is derived from the copyrighted binary, is NOT covered
by either licence above, and is not committed to this repository. It is
regenerated locally by `scripts/recompile.ps1` from your own `default.xex`.

`tools/XenonRecomp` is a submodule of hedge-dev/XenonRecomp, MIT licensed, with
local patches applied as described in `tools/patches/README.md`.
